 intro="MDMA and psilocybin are the two psychedelics with the strongest clinical evidence for therapy. MDMA is an empathogen — it opens emotional connection. Shrooms are a classic psychedelic — they dissolve the usual frame of mind. 'Hippie flipping' (taking both) exists precisely because they're so different.",
