 title="Salvia vs DMT",
 intro="Salvia divinorum and DMT are the two shortest, most intense non-ordinary states available. DMT is a 10-minute rocket to a geometric cosmos. Salvia is a 5-minute freefall into a world where your body, name and memories stop existing — and many people find it far less friendly.",
