       ("Legal access", "Schedule I (US) since 1978", "OTC everywhere; age-restricted sale in some states"),
       ("Duration", "4–8 h", "4–8 h (polistirex versions longer)"),
       ("The 'feel'", "Heavy dissociation, possible agitation, the PCP walk", "Floaty, robotic, often euphoric or confusing"),
