       ("The 'feel' at high doses", "Floaty calm, mild euphoria, music enhancement", "Same but stronger — 'liquid confidence'"),
       ("Dependence", "Real with daily high-dose use; withdrawal: anxiety, insomnia, pain rebound", "Real; withdrawal similar but often harder — pregabalin is the bigger abuse problem"),
